


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_1ddc66d1:


    "除了文以外的三个正优哉游哉地度过离晚饭饭点还早的这段时间。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_dbe52ab5:



    voice "2RI_1161"
    rin "「呜呜～～啊啊～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_2fcff5de:


    "在地板上滚来滚去的，睡衣怪发出了哀鸣声。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_bea85138:



    voice "2MI_0918"
    miyako "「啊，是海豹？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_fbbc46fe:


    "点着脑袋打瞌睡的圣夜子抬起了头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_b21b6928:



    voice "2HI_1121"
    hina "「不不不，那是伦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_8370dbf5:



    voice "2RI_1162"
    rin "「呜呜～～啊～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_b4a826cb:


    "再度发出哀鸣的伦在地板上扭动着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_9d651aae:



    voice "2MI_0919"
    miyako "「……伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_665d8c29:



    voice "2HI_1122"
    hina "「由着她吧。等浅生回来后她就会没事的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_80628a74:



    voice "2RI_1163"
    rin "「……严重缺文……要死」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_6696163c:



    voice "2HI_1123"
    hina "「真是夸张。最近不是每周都这样嘛。再忍忍就好了——呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_30710bb6:



    voice "2RI_1164"
    rin "「呜啊～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_549a79fc:


    "就在阳菜瞄了下钟的那一瞬间，伦的手像章鱼一样缠住了阳菜的身体。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_e0bc6a1e:



    voice "2HI_1124"
    hina "「喂，搞什么啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_2d2900b6:



    voice "2RI_1165"
    rin "「……完全没料」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d0d96d11:


    "伦幽幽地抱怨道并满脸嫌弃的甩开了阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_7b42f874:



    voice "2HI_1125"
    hina "「火大」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_a6ebda40:



    voice "2RI_1166"
    rin "「呜呜～～啊啊～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_ded17c8a:


    "又来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_af18b238:



    voice "2MI_0920"
    miyako "「如果不介意的话，要来抱抱我吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d86370a9:


    "圣夜子展开双臂。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_ab9f6fc0:



    voice "2HI_1126"
    hina "「不用给她抱的啦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_8fdf748d:



    voice "2RI_1167"
    rin "「啊啊～～！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_2e3f70c6:



    voice "2HI_1127"
    hina "「你好烦！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_996421f5:



    voice "2RI_1168"
    rin "「文！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_cff73ead:


    "伦猛然起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d2c66eb6:



    voice "2SA_0753"
    sachiko "「打扰啦～如果是自由拥抱会的话也算我一个啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_dc7e2f45:


    "然而从门背后露了半张脸出来的人却是祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_c4f1e4e0:



    voice "2RI_1169"
    rin "「呜呜～～啊～～！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d8d1704f:


    "伦摆出露骨的失落表情后瘫倒在地并再次发出了哀鸣。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_c336d1a5:



    voice "2SA_0754"
    sachiko "「来，阳菜，来我这～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_72b4fd8a:



    voice "2HI_1128"
    hina "「不！我才不抱！滚啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_8cf8a4bb:



    voice "2MI_0921"
    miyako "「要来抱抱吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d86370a9_1:


    "圣夜子展开双臂。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_92cf68e7:



    voice "2HI_1129"
    hina "「不用给她抱！回去·回去·快回去！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_0ab5a5df:



    voice "2SA_0755"
    sachiko "「没啦，其实我是真的有事才来的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_1b40d7e8:


    "祥子说着并递出了一本薄薄的小册子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d753ab38:



    voice "2MI_0922"
    miyako "「那是什么来的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_52dd2846:



    voice "2SA_0756"
    sachiko "「也就地方的社区杂志而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_0f7f8f32:



    voice "2HI_1130"
    hina "「有附送折扣券的那个吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_bea66b2f:



    voice "2SA_0757"
    sachiko "「没错。只不过这次不是让你们看那个。不知道那边那个有气无力的家伙会不会感兴趣呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_b876227b:



    voice "2RI_1170"
    rin "「没兴趣。如果有文的话那就另当别论」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_683f8126:


    "伦轱辘地转过身去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_0b2fa8b2:



    voice "2MI_0923"
    miyako "「封面上的是文诶」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_ece8a14c:



    voice "2HI_1131"
    hina "「啊，真的是」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d7627c13:



    voice "2RI_1171"
    rin "「你·说·什·么——！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_16ab8f47:


    "伦猛然弹了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_2152e48a:


    "三个人轮番地翻阅着这本社区杂志。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_e416bd90:


    "文不仅仅是作为法式点心店的看板娘登在杂志封面上，杂志里也有不少页用到文的照片，完全就是情人节特别刊的主角。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_551bc8a8:



    voice "2RI_1172"
    rin "「哈？停一下！我要窒息了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_23fd0932:


    "伦瞄了一下阳菜和圣夜子所翻阅着的那本社区杂志后，说什么太耀眼了无法直视并站了起来激动地在房间里徘徊着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_813ea8fc:



    voice "2SA_0758"
    sachiko "「有兴趣了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_b51d02a6:



    voice "2RI_1173"
    rin "「祥子姐，请问您是在哪里获得这本杂志的？我需要至少三本，分别用作观赏、收藏和安利！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_477266c8:



    voice "2SA_0759"
    sachiko "「在车站那边搞到的，估计还有很多哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_18aa835c:



    voice "2RI_1174"
    rin "「该把所有的都回收过来吗？慢，此举岂非阻挠天下人知晓文可人之处哉？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_efea9001:



    voice "2SA_0760"
    sachiko "「岂什么非啦。一般来说都不行吧，毕竟说是免费但实质上还算是商品嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_7b8c4de6:



    voice "2HI_1132"
    hina "「快看，好像说下次要去拍浅生家的店然后在电视上播出来哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_4d831edb:



    voice "2RI_1175"
    rin "「什么时候！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_176dc0fb:



    voice "2HI_1133"
    hina "「我看看……说是在下周日进行摄影然后当天晚上播出的样子，算是即拍即播了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_99e764a8:



    voice "2MI_0924"
    miyako "「文要上电视了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_a4949c3e:



    voice "2HI_1134"
    hina "「毕竟是看板娘嘛～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_3664ec3e:



    voice "2RI_1176"
    rin "「去买台100寸的大电视吧！要4k还是8k？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_f2815d73:



    voice "2HI_1135"
    hina "「哪来那么多钱。再说就算能买回来也没那么大的空间给你放啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_a3ecf842:



    voice "2RI_1177"
    rin "「把阳菜的桌子给扔了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_0c01a47a:



    voice "2HI_1136"
    hina "「喂！还有地方电视台的地上波是不会播4k节目的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_c3db4c96:



    voice "2RI_1178"
    rin "「啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_31f82c18:


    "伦因为情绪太过高涨而变得有点莫名其妙了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_c41ca93d:



    voice "2FU_0886"
    fumi "「我回来了……嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_0f95cf98:


    "四个人的视线朝说话声的方向集中。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_b3e6be6c:



    voice "2FU_0887"
    fumi "「咦，人怎么这么齐——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_08e56bb8:


    "文看到了伦手上的社区杂志后马上就明白是什么状况了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_22e797fb:



    voice "2FU_0888"
    fumi "「……唉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_1ab3c3bb:


    "仰天长叹。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_32ce6d59:



    voice "2FU_0889"
    fumi "「这是在哪弄来的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_6b757132:


    "文一边翻着桌上的小册子一边问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_2485f573:



    voice "2SA_0761"
    sachiko "「我在车站那看到然后就带回来了，该不会不行吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_7905bdcd:



    voice "2FU_0890"
    fumi "「不是，既然是免费赠阅的那自然不是不行，只不过我在想原来已经出版了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_385e534e:



    voice "2RI_1179"
    rin "「文！为什么这么大的事你不告诉我啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_4e2a8bb2:


    "文被飞身扑上来的伦吓了一下。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_b3a28d83:



    voice "2FU_0891"
    fumi "「哇！？也算不上是大事啦，只是些小杂志刊载了店铺的宣传而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_03a01572:



    voice "2RI_1180"
    rin "「这可是上了封面，上了封面啊？我的文上封面了——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d8ea899c:


    "伦将封面高高举在头上展示着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_4f3a2d7d:



    voice "2FU_0892"
    fumi "「我还想着说这只会在当地发送然后印刷量也不多，你们肯定找不到的……伦，快把那个给我！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_fcc01f8d:


    "空战还是伦比较强。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_5971eeb8:



    voice "2MI_0925"
    miyako "「这个是在什么时候拍的呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_9a644784:



    voice "2FU_0893"
    fumi "「大概一个月前吧。我在看店的时候偶然遇上来取材的。不过一开始是打算拍我父亲的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_e140437d:



    voice "2SA_0762"
    sachiko "「只不过，有个那么可爱的看板娘的话那当然就还是拍看板娘啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_c5bf3473:


    "伦以极快的速度猛点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_83d58585:



    voice "2FU_0894"
    fumi "「其实我也是拒绝了好久哦？毕竟我不喜欢引人注目。然而最后还是摄影师再三请求所以就……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_5d5764eb:



    voice "2HI_1137"
    hina "「不过，还是拍下了非常棒的笑容呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_5348a967:


    "正如阳菜所说的，封面上的文表情非常自然而美妙。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_4c33c1cf:



    voice "2FU_0895"
    fumi "「实际上重拍了不知道多少次的，因为我完全没法自然地笑出来」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_52801a68:



    voice "2HI_1138"
    hina "「那这可以说是，充满奇迹的一张？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_ddf7c390:



    voice "2FU_0896"
    fumi "「奇迹倒不至于吧……其实那只是张在我对一个偶然进店里来的常客打招呼时所拍下的照片而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_28db9b20:



    voice "2HI_1139"
    hina "「啊哈哈，原来如此，难怪表情会那么自然」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_2c2f60d3:



    voice "2MI_0926"
    miyako "「哦对了。文下个星期要上电视了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_40b30a6a:



    voice "2FU_0897"
    fumi "「上电视是指？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_2a500d83:


    "满脸疑惑的文反问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_20d0d37d:



    voice "2RI_1181"
    rin "「看看这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_d84cdf0d:


    "伦翻开了特辑的那一页并指了指写了关于电视节目取材的地方。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_b1c6e1cb:



    voice "2FU_0898"
    fumi "「诶？诶？我没听说有这回事啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_f5a37a88:



    voice "2RI_1182"
    rin "「文，我绝对会去看的喔！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_04_1434366e:



    voice "2FU_0899"
    fumi "「这、这就有点……」"
